      "id": "macbeth/sceneI_20.5/p@26964",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Great Glamis, worthy Cawdor!\nGreater than both, by the all-hail hereafter!\nThy letters have transported me beyond\nThis ignorant present, and I feel now\nThe future in the instant.",
